el=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/93.html\">Surah Ad-Dhuhaa</a> › Ayat 7</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ad-Dhuhaa 93:7</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَوَجَدَكَ ضَالًّا فَهَدَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan didapatiNya engkau mencari-cari (jalan yang benar), lalu Ia memberikan hidayah petunjuk (dengan wahyu - Al-Quran)?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقد يكون في سياق أنه لا يسمع ولا يعلم إلا ما أسمعه الله إياه وأعلمه إياه، فإنه [ليس]، من تلقاء نفسه ليس له [علم بشيء]، بل الله هو الذي أسمعه وأعلمه،<cite>«الاستغاثة في الرد على البكري» 1/360</cite></blockquote><h3>Apa yang beliau nukilkan daripada orang lain</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عطية</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «وجده فأغاثه إنعامه بالنبوة والرسالة على غير الطريق التي هو عليها في نبوته»<cite>«تفسير آيات أشكلت على كثير من العلماء» 1/209</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله {ألم يجدك يتيما فآوى ووجدك ضالا فهدى ووجدك عائلا فأغنى} [الضحى: 6] وقوله {إنا وجدناه صابرا} [ص: 44] فهذا كله من الوجود والثبوت.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/89</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s93a7\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/93-6.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (93:6)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/93-8.html\">Ayat seterusnya (93:8)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/93-8.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ad-Dhuhaa 93:8 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan didapatiNya engkau miskin, lalu Ia memberikan kekayaan?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/93-8.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ad-Dhuhaa 93:8 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan didapatiNya engkau miskin, lalu Ia memberikan kekayaan?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Ad-Dhuhaa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/93.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 8\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/93-8.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/93.html\">Surah Ad-Dhuhaa</a> › Ayat 8</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ad-Dhuhaa 93:8</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَوَجَدَكَ عَائِلًا فَأَغْنَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan didapatiNya engkau miskin, lalu Ia memberikan kekayaan?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله {ألم يجدك يتيما فآوى ووجدك ضالا فهدى ووجدك عائلا فأغنى} [الضحى: 6] وقوله {إنا وجدناه صابرا} [ص: 44] فهذا كله من الوجود والثبوت.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/89</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s93a8\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/93-7.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (93:7)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/93-10.html\">Ayat seterusnya (93:10)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/93-10.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ad-Dhuhaa 93:10 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Adapun orang yang meminta (bantuan pimpinan) maka janganlah engkau tengking herdik;\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://t